    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῐάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιάζω</span>
			, <i>overshadow, make shady</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λῆμνον . . ἀκροτάτῃ κορυφῇ σκιάει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.604
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				864
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				30
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be shaded</i> or <i>dark</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσετό τ᾽ ἠέλιος σκιόωντό τε πᾶσαι
			ἀγυιαί</span> (
				Ep.
			3pl.
			impf.) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.388
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				600
			</span></i>.</div>
